generation:
The German Emperor, buried today, 
His coffin, borne by princes and generals; 

All the dignitaries in Germany have come to bid him farewell, 
At the funeral ceremony, where all are in black; 

He was a great leader, beloved by his people, 
And will be remembered for all the good he has done; 

We pray for his soul, may it rest in peace, 
And for his family, who are in mourning; 

The emperor was a great man, who will be missed, 
His legacy will live on forever; 

We pay our respects to him today, 
At this solemn ceremony.
